content.value:
Declare four private DcMotor fields: frontLeft, backLeft, frontRight, backRight.

In init(), get all four from hardwareMap using their names: "front_left_motor", "back_left_motor", "front_right_motor", "back_right_motor".

Then reverse the left-side motors:

frontLeft.setDirection(DcMotorSimple.Direction.REVERSE);
backLeft.setDirection(DcMotorSimple.Direction.REVERSE);
